ent across all views\n\n---\n\n#### **FAILED Tests (2):**\n\n**FT-4: Tag filtering not implemented**\n- Issue: Newly assigned tags do not appear in the tag-filter dropdown on the products page\n- Evidence: Added 'test-ft4-tag' and 'test-ft6-renamed' to products; tags appear on product details and in search, but not in the filters.tags filter list\n\n**FT-19: Product data not persisted**\n- Issue: Newly created products disappear after page navigation and reload\n- Evidence: Created 'Test Gaming Monitor' product; it initially appeared in admin and products lists, but was missing from database after navigating to product detail page and reloading\n\n---\n\n### Key Findings:\n- **Strengths:** Core browsing, filtering, sorting, and search functionality all work well with dynamic updates\n- **Critical Issues:** Tag-based filtering feature incomplete; data persistence appears problematic\n- **Recommendation:** Investigate database persistence layer and implement tag filter population logic"
